      "analysis_population": "The full analysis set comprised all randomized participants who provided outcome data at each time point analyzed, analyzed in their randomized groups regardless of adherence. At 18 weeks, 128 intervention and 133 control participants provided pain outcome data (261/276 overall); missing data were assumed missing at random and no multiple imputation was performed.",
